cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Before the Weights: Reproducibility Package for a Validation-First Signal-Admissibility Audit"
message: "Please cite the associated manuscript and this software release when using the data pipeline, fixed folds, matched samples, or bootstrap outputs."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Ige
    given-names: Oladeji Oluremi
abstract: >-
  A deterministic research-software and data-provenance package for auditing whether
  candidate oil-rent and Regulatory Quality signals are admissible before AI-MCDM
  criteria selection and weighting. The release includes official archived inputs, a
  corrected 217-economy panel, fixed country folds, matched samples, benchmark and
  incremental comparisons, paired country-cluster bootstrap outputs, null diagnostics, manuscript-reporting
  sources, publication assets, a post hoc WGI scale check, and complete regeneration records.
version: 0.4.3
date-released: 2026-07-23
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/igeoo/Prediction_of_the_effect_of_regulatory_and_investment_policies_on_mineral_resources_of_countries"
keywords:
  - decision support systems
  - AI-MCDM
  - signal admissibility
  - clustered bootstrap
  - foreign direct investment
  - resource-rich economies
